<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug petroleum output up 12.31 pct yr/y.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug petroleum output up 12.31 pct yr/y.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 21.89 million tonnes of petroleum in the first eight months of 1996, up 12.31 percent from the same period last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>Petroleum output in August alone was 2.73 million tonnes, it said.</p>
